          "gap": 4,
          "padding": 12,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "tCsXE",
              "fill": "$severity-high",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "byte[] key = \"MedusaSays\\u0000\\u0000\".getBytes();",
              "fontFamily": "Courier Prime",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "1bECv",
              "fill": "$primary-cyan",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "SecretKeySpec k = new SecretKeySpec(key, \"AES\");",
              "fontFamily": "Courier Prime",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ajY1y",
              "fill": "$muted-cyan",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "// .rodata offset 0x1A2F → same bytes in libcrypto.so",
              "fontFamily": "Courier Prime",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "yePyq",
          "name": "mitLabel",
          "fill": "$accent-acid",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "// MITIGATION",
          "fontFamily": "Courier Prime",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "700",
          "letterSpacing": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "7OEpD",
          "name": "mitBox",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "$bg-accent-panel",
          "cornerRadius": 2,
          "stroke": {
            "thickness": 1,
            "fill": "$border-accent"
          },
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": 12,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Lh35D",
              "fill": "$accent-acid",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "1. Never ship keys inside the binary. Derive per-install via Android Keystore (KeyGenParameterSpec, hardware-backed).",
              "fontFamily": "Courier Prime",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Pu5q9",
              "fill": "$accent-acid",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "2. For envelope encryption, fetch a Data Encryption Key from backend over mTLS, wrap it with a Keystore-protected KEK.",
              "fontFamily": "Courier Prime",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "zEXF8",
              "fill": "$accent-acid",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "3. Rotate. Revoke. Audit. Ship a plan, not a panic.",
              "fontFamily": "Courier Prime",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
